("h3", "Combination and exothermic or endothermic changes"),
("p", "Reactions that release heat are **exothermic**: burning of natural gas, respiration (glucose with oxygen) and decomposition of vegetable matter into compost. Reactions that absorb heat are **endothermic**, such as the decomposition of calcium carbonate."),
